# Build outputs -- regenerated by `build_vi.py` and the test drivers.
# VI.COM is the shipped deliverable and VI.SYM is its symbol table
# (the test harness reads it), so both are committed, as are the M80
# listings of VI.COM's own modules; every other .COM (test stubs), the
# test programs' listings, the other symbol tables and relocatables are not.
*.COM
!VI.COM
*.SYM
!VI.SYM
*.PRN
!VI.PRN
!SCRN.PRN
!CMD.PRN
!KEY.PRN
!PAGE.PRN
!BUF.PRN
!RSV.PRN
*.REL

# Test scratch: per-run disk copies and host files the harness writes here.
# The *.TXT inputs (CMDIN, MOTIN, PGIN) are written by their driver each run.
_smoke_work/
*.TXT
*.BAK

# Simulator + tooling state
.altairsim_history
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
_fastcheck/
_smoke_work/
_paintcost_work/

# Local simulator setup, kept out of the repo
ALTAIRSIM.DSK
DRIVING-WITH-AI.md
